  <h2 id="t1">1. Overview</h2>
  <p>This website is operated by [{AppName} legal entity name] ("{AppName}", "we", "us"). These Terms of Service ("Terms") apply to everyone who visits [yourdomain].com or buys from us. By using the site or placing an order, you agree to these Terms and to the policies they reference, including our <a href="{{ privacy_url }}">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="{{ refund_url }}">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a> and <a href="{{ shipping_url }}">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="t2">2. Using Our Store</h2>
  <p>You must be at least the age of majority where you live to place an order. You agree not to use our products or site for any unlawful purpose. We may refuse service to anyone, for any lawful reason, at any time. Our store is hosted on Shopify.</p>

  <h2 id="t3">3. Pricing &amp; Promotions</h2>
  <h3>Compare-at prices</h3>
  <p>Where we show a crossed-out or "compare at" price, it reflects [the price at which the item was previously offered / an MSRP], as described on the product page. Savings figures are calculated from that price.</p>
  <h3>Promotions and codes</h3>
  <p>Promotions run for the period stated, may be limited to stock on hand, and can't be combined unless we say so. Free gifts are added while supplies last.</p>
  <h3>Pricing errors</h3>
  <p>If a product is listed at an incorrect price, we may cancel the order and refund you, even after it's confirmed.</p>

  <h2 id="t4">4. Orders &amp; Billing</h2>
  <p>We may limit or cancel quantities per person, household or order. You agree to give current, complete and accurate purchase and account information, and to update it promptly. If we change or cancel an order, we'll try to notify you using the email or phone number you gave us.</p>

  <h2 id="t5">5. Products &amp; Accuracy</h2>
  <p>We try to show colours and details accurately, but your screen may vary. Product descriptions, availability and prices may change without notice. If information on the site is inaccurate or out of date, we may correct it at any time, including after you've placed an order.</p>

  <h2 id="t6">6. Third-Party Tools &amp; Links</h2>
  <p>We may offer tools or links from third parties, such as payment providers, review platforms or social media. We don't control them and aren't responsible for their content or practices. Your use of them is at your own risk and under their terms.</p>

  <h2 id="t7">7. Reviews &amp; Content You Share</h2>
  <p>When you send us reviews, photos, videos, comments or ideas, or tag us on social media with [#SleepWith{AppName}], you give {AppName} a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide licence to use, edit and display that content in any media, with credit where practical. You confirm the content is yours, is truthful, and doesn't infringe anyone's rights. We may remove content we find unlawful, offensive or misleading. We don't pay for or edit the meaning of reviews; incentivised reviews are labelled as such.</p>

  <h2 id="t8">8. Personal Information</h2>
  <p>How we handle your personal information is described in our <a href="{{ privacy_url }}">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="t9">9. Prohibited Uses</h2>
  <p>You may not use the site to break any law; infringe our or anyone's intellectual property; harass or discriminate; submit false information; upload malicious code; collect others' data; scrape or spam; or interfere with the site's security. We may end your access for breaching this section.</p>

  <h2 id="t10">10. Health &amp; Product Claims</h2>
  <p>{AppName} products are designed to support comfortable sleep. They are not medical devices and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Results vary from person to person. If you have a medical condition, sleep disorder, or ongoing pain, talk to a qualified healthcare professional. Statements such as "cooling" describe how products are designed to feel and are based on [describe testing], not a guarantee of a specific temperature change.</p>

  <h2 id="t11">11. Disclaimer of Warranties &amp; Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p class="caps">Except as stated in our written limited warranty, the site and products are provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p>
  <p class="caps">To the fullest extent permitted by law, {AppName} will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages. Our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount you paid for the product involved.</p>
  <p>Some jurisdictions don't allow these limits, so they may not apply to you. Nothing here limits rights you have under consumer protection law.</p>

  <h2 id="t12">12. Indemnification</h2>
  <p>You agree to defend and hold harmless {AppName} and its team from claims arising from your breach of these Terms or your violation of any law or third-party right.</p>

  <h2 id="t13">13. Binding Arbitration &amp; Class Action Waiver</h2>
  <p>[Please have counsel review this section.] Any dispute with {AppName} will be resolved by binding individual arbitration administered by [arbitration body] under its consumer rules, rather than in court, except that you may bring qualifying claims in small claims court. You and {AppName} waive the right to a jury trial and to participate in class actions. You may opt out of this section within [30] days of your first purchase by emailing [legal@yourdomain.com] with your name and the words "arbitration opt-out".</p>

  <h2 id="t14">14. Advertising Disclosures</h2>
  <p>Some creators, affiliates and ambassadors receive free products, commissions or payment for sharing {AppName}. They're asked to disclose that relationship clearly. Press mentions and awards shown on our site link to, or name, their original source.</p>

  <h2 id="t15">15. Termination &amp; Severability</h2>
  <p>These Terms apply until ended by you or us. You can end them by no longer using the site. If any part of these Terms is found unenforceable, the rest still applies, and the unenforceable part will be limited to the minimum extent necessary.</p>

  <h2 id="t16">16. Governing Law &amp; Entire Agreement</h2>
  <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of [State / Country], without regard to conflict-of-law rules. They, together with the policies linked above, are the entire agreement between you and {AppName} about the site and supersede any prior agreements.</p>

  <h2 id="t17">17. Changes to These Terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. The effective date at the top shows when they last changed. Continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

